  "description": "Stop using legacy 3D gray WinForms buttons. ModernButtons.WinForms provides hardware-accelerated, anti-aliased Modern Buttons for Windows Forms. Features 10 unique geometric shapes (Pill, Leaf, Hexagon, etc.), an advanced Text/Image layout engine, native AutoEllipsis, glowing animations, native Dark Mode, and extreme state customization. Seamlessly inherits native WinForms Button properties for perfect DialogResult routing, Click events, and Image layout integration.",
