  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 Massive Layout & Customization Update:\n\t\t\t- Introduced 10 brand new physical shapes (Pill, Leaf, Hexagon, TearDrop, CutCorners, Trapezoid, Underline, Ghost, Elevated3D, Standard).\n\t\t\t- Decoupled colors from shapes: Use `ColorStyle` for palettes and `Style` for structural geometry.\n\t\t\t- Brand new Layout Engine fully supporting `TextImageRelation`, `ImageAlign`, and `TextAlign`.\n\t\t\t- Perfected Disabled state rendering (auto-grayscales background, text, and foreground images natively).\n\t\t\t- Fixed `AutoEllipsis` text trimming and `BackgroundImage` rendering (images perfectly clip to custom shapes).\n\t\t\t- Unlocked `BorderRadius` and `BorderWidth` globally for all styles.\n\t\t\t- Extreme Customization Mode: Added 16 new color properties allowing full manual control over Normal, Hover, Pressed, and Disabled states for Backgrounds, Text, and Borders.",
